  "_README": "Single source-of-truth registry for every map data layer (roadmap IN-2). Keyed by GeoJSON feature property. `METRIC_SOURCES` in src/utils/metrics.ts is generated from `metrics` here, and src/__tests__/dataSourceRegistry.test.ts + scripts/validate_data.py enforce that every layer has a registry row so attribution can never silently drift. Per metric: `source` = human-readable dataset label shown in the UI, `publisher` = key into `publishers` (carries the clickable URL + license), `vintage` = data year(s), `granularity` = finest resolution actually shipped, `is_proxy` = true when the value is a regression/derived estimate rather than a direct measurement, `stored` = false only for values computed purely client-side (absent from the GeoJSON), `panel` = false to keep a derived/composite metric out of the per-row source attribution map.",
